[patterns-user-input-pick-index] Pick > The pick dialog > List or table

Pick — Find and collect records from a collection, then commit them as a set.

Not every pick needs a table. When you choose a record by its name, with at most a supporting line and no grid of comparable detail to scan across rows, a [`<SelectList>`](/components/form/selectlist) is the lighter collection: a multi-select list, checked to stage and committed the same way. An option can still carry a little more than a bare label, such as a name over an email, and it stays a list. Reach for a [`<Table>`](/components/collection/table) only once the records carry several attributes worth comparing side by side.

